  "slug": "unique-spicy-portuguese-radish-skewers",
  "title": "Spicy Portuguese Radish Skewers",
  "description": "A quick and spicy appetizer or snack that combines the flavors of Portugal with the crunch of radish. Serve with a side of pita chips or crackers.",
  "cuisine": "portuguese",
  "diet": [
